i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LopokHCA9KEQ7kNvwHPvd_L&_nc_oc=Adp5EX4hiHzs24cHxhpa70iRrxOpXp85hdPUZKMvSJdyS8VvalrTqFKJQsKCYyox7c4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKLd1Ld2Wygk2uoe5EStsMLSMOBNUj1AXgMVO0hbUVtiw&oe=6AA41966"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CJZOq8aa-2gQ7kNvwHt28m-&_nc_oc=Adr2EwFTxAdxyPnZnlt1AkCGaURHfXw5LvOphjV5lVrTy3U0x3cUXSSforBGLTv274g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIXUrmgf-yiVIQJoU5qcsa5mrR_Pk5gI8kFvd7_zVv0gg&oe=6AA40EB2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ic0g2C8pDvcQ7kNvwEDxE6X&_nc_oc=AdoVd0T1cKFS2AHBVQiCHlWsdlpar5dBXlM9IC4RXLIIFOWLB552gmfjC-H7TQlQKZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVmgofqqdabILOaR9aH5yH_AiDmVWcg13DY3UMS336Rg&oe=6AA4087B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ixEY9A5VnxQQ7kNvwEeI5Pv&_nc_oc=AdqsqeLwgAOpAQe8S0GzWrgT9OZKmX083Qn1d0aeNamD-DKlHTlvvtehSvzipxHrFmM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJMVsoSP7PeLCrGopMTPjWBSSiDErHEaz9lHfKRjPWHRw&oe=6AA41DF3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=92MaOnjPJOUQ7kNvwF1FEVH&_nc_oc=AdoCJnmngjftzmunslEq2fQP9poiSk-gUYT03px2IPTgPCI99w37XIUH4F_uMMzP0So&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKpcJp2Y4b-Mta92rb90jAeIJMC5P-mpfrBWOILZYJl1A&oe=6AA41BF2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bliSWWWVDuwQ7kNvwFrHICB&_nc_oc=AdrkaznVshTpSB-arVF9umtmmZs8_nS2hjy1zd86V_sDo5SSVwLKs2wgevexV1IG9iU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIsOBcZbYTtrG8R6s81HA70sSo4ahctNK5LY7Kcd45paw&oe=6AA41353"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eGyHAQfJb4sQ7kNvwFpvYfZ&_nc_oc=AdpwBTJxuMy5KkP4LRvIXdAFNAXF1YPyAvDN7H9-Sxj6mklb1o7lLgyY5_OFmi4k9gc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIMiKRrpLStF0pv7IG8LYQ4JtOXgKDqNmeGPdbh6wgX2g&oe=6AA40F6F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d-z_7dGUoEAQ7kNvwFZMJah&_nc_oc=AdqL72BaV-c5CbudGzxs2uKIrWtjUUhPlZvWlfIdM0v0jrBGQUniiYyfw3w46ubjECg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLNmn15vPGx2388M7-lxsVrN6uUMcYSmHdaT4T3Uqee-A&oe=6AA41B22"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_